WEBVTT

00:02.680 --> 00:04.280
Quickly escort me out of camp

00:26.500 --> 00:32.500
In the blink of an eye, the situation had shifted; Shi Lang replicated your past desperate counterattack in like manner.

00:33.000 --> 00:38.500
Seeing the dragon banner fall, Wunu morale surged instantly, crying out 'The Xuan Emperor is dead!', throwing the Xuan army into utter chaos and headlong retreat.

00:39.000 --> 00:46.000
In the end, Wunu decisively routed the Xuan army, and you too failed to escape the fate of captivity...

